[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3660.23, "timestamp": "01:01:00", "text": "不，你可以卖任何东西。不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3663.109, "timestamp": "01:01:03", "text": "无论合法与否，你都可以"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3665.829, "timestamp": "01:01:05", "author": "@RyzexCh", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/amK2Y62apvFDa_Drvh1DcQn8KTERvc2-tn67_8Tfb4CDDptav6v-n5VMsBR3U5XQAh1NLxsr1Q=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "drogs UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/m8MfY4jbFsWJhL0PyouA2AkUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/m8MfY4jbFsWJhL0PyouA2Ak"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3667.75, "timestamp": "01:01:07", "text": "它。而且那东西不一定非得……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3669.829, "timestamp": "01:01:09", "text": "存在。如果你只是说，“我在卖东西”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3671.67, "timestamp": "01:01:11", "text": "这东西。”所以，你只是在卖它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3684.23, "timestamp": "01:01:24", "text": "呃，我需要赚一大笔钱吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3687.19, "timestamp": "01:01:27", "text": "我应该满足于金钱还是其他东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3689.43, "timestamp": "01:01:29", "text": "中等或少量金额？你你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3692.829, "timestamp": "01:01:32", "text": "你想收多少钱都行。啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3696.87, "timestamp": "01:01:36", "text": "好的。我想说毒品，但不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3698.27, "timestamp": "01:01:38", "text": "那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3701.75, "timestamp": "01:01:41", "text": "坏的。它还可能让你重回监狱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3704.23, "timestamp": "01:01:44", "text": "所以，不，但这不会让你进入"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3708.549, "timestamp": "01:01:48", "text": "监狱。等等，为什么？哦，因为在这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3712.349, "timestamp": "01:01:52", "text": "在这种情况下，不会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3715.43, "timestamp": "01:01:55", "text": "哦。我的天啊。但或许是人民"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3719.63, "timestamp": "01:01:59", "text": "你卖给的那个人会被逮捕。"}]